Description: An in-console, gamified learning and practice engine for R.
    Solve algorithmic and data-wrangling challenges directly in RStudio,
    get instant feedback with explanations, track your progress with a
    local streak tracker, and automatically sync solved challenges to
    a GitHub portfolio repository.
